### ==================== AUTHENTICATION ====================

### Register new account
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "letantest",
  "password": "Test@123456",
  "hoTen": "Lê Tân Test",
  "email": "letantest@clinic.com",
  "dienThoai": "0912345678",
  "vaiTro": "LeTan"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test456",
  "password": "Test@123"
}

### Get current user (Protected - needs token)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6NiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ0ZXN0NDU2Iiwicm9sZSI6IkxlVGFuIiwiaWF0IjoxNzcxODQzNTE2LCJleHAiOjE3NzI0NDgzMTZ9.7sqdMWypMWQ34MvmVyA0RMZcityZ_uvou4dad6qlgH8

